  "suffix": "Materials: (reflections running the whole length of the body line, paint reading wet even when it is dry, tyre sidewall relief and brake hardware legible inside the wheel arch:1.2). Deep shadows that still hold information, highlights that stop short of clipping, and road surface carrying its own grain under the machine.",
